=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  timesync review-alpine ---------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Proposed: no Figma frame. alpine's Set servers: no drop-in,$
# hardn's words in /etc/conf.d/ntpd under a comment naming the$
# ones they replace, and the restart that reads them.$
$
  Checking the host...$
$
# Set servers ##################################################$
$
# Note$
# hardn's servers take the place of the host's own. Remove$
# servers puts those back.$
$
  Time ---------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Server               192.0.2.10 by hardn$
   -  Server               192.0.2.11 by hardn$
$
   -  Set ntpd's servers$
      /etc/conf.d/ntpd$
      @@ -1,2 +1,3 @@$
       # By default ntpd runs as a client. Add -l to run as a$
      | server on port 123.$
      -NTPD_OPTS="-N -p pool.ntp.org"$
      +# Set by hardn (NTP Settings), in place of: -p$
      | pool.ntp.org$
      +NTPD_OPTS="-N -p 192.0.2.10 -p 192.0.2.11"$
$
   -  Restart ntpd$
      ntpd$
      $ rc-service ntpd restart$
$
  Set time servers? [y/N, 0 or q]: $
$
$

